\title{PRSTR: plan to increase emphasis on ``model.matrix'' and incorporate ``Regression and other stories''.\\
  Two meanings of ``contrast'' in R:\\
  coding the model versus specifying the comparisons, limma's makeContrasth, glht and mcp's contrMat, emmeans, model.matrix, options(contrasts), et al.}
\author{Ramon Diaz-Uriarte, with a response by Claude}
\date{17 November 2026}

